@prefix : <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/iao.owl#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

:InformationArtifactOntology rdfs:comment "The ontology that provides terms for information artifacts and related concepts." .

owl:AnnotationProperty rdfs:comment "The class of all OWL annotation properties." .

owl:Class rdfs:comment "The class of all OWL classes." .

owl:DatatypeProperty rdfs:comment "The class of all OWL datatype properties." .

owl:ObjectProperty rdfs:comment "The class of all OWL object properties." .

